The patches in this repository modify the following files:

- app/src/main/java/com/kieronquinn/app/taptap/utils/extensions/Extensions+Service.kt
- app/src/main/java/com/kieronquinn/app/taptap/components/columbus/actions/custom/LaunchAppAction.kt
- app/src/main/java/com/kieronquinn/app/taptap/repositories/actions/ActionsRepository.kt

Modifications:
1. Use FOREGROUND_SERVICE_TYPE_SPECIAL_USE so the foreground service
   matches the manifest and actually enters the foreground on Android 14+.
2. Remove the "target app is already open" availability gate so the
   action can be triggered repeatedly.
3. For com.dsh.screenqa, send the local broadcast
   com.dsh.screenqa.CAPTURE instead of starting an Activity.
4. Pre-set the default double-tap action to launch ScreenQA.

